Package: gazahomes
Type: Package
Title: Explore Published Household Indicators from a Gaza Housing Study
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Sulaiman M. S.", "Allouh", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "me@sulaimanallouh.com")
Description: Read nine published aggregate household indicators and their
    bilingual question dictionary from a Gaza housing study. Reconcile
    denominators with recorded exclusions and check reported percentages
    against the released counts. The included records are aggregate data;
    the package does not contain individual participant records.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: utils
URL: https://github.com/SulaimanAllouh/gaza-resilient-homes-research
